WEBVTT

00:51.634 --> 00:52.469
Ha-gyeong.

00:53.428 --> 00:54.262
Min-beom.

00:54.345 --> 00:55.597
Where is Gang-yong?

00:55.680 --> 00:57.515
He has a brain hemorrhage.

00:57.599 --> 00:58.933
He's in surgery now.

01:01.352 --> 01:03.563
MIN GANG-YONG: PROCEDURE IN PROGRESS

01:14.574 --> 01:15.575
Woo-jin.

01:16.159 --> 01:17.535
What's wrong, Woo-jin?

01:18.536 --> 01:20.705
-It's Kang In-beom.
-Yeah?

01:22.499 --> 01:24.209
He took your mom.

01:24.793 --> 01:25.710
What?

01:26.294 --> 01:27.670
I'm sorry.

01:31.174 --> 01:33.468
I couldn't protect her.

01:34.052 --> 01:37.722
Someone like me doesn't deserve to live.

01:37.806 --> 01:40.225
Don't say that, Woo-jin.

01:40.308 --> 01:42.185
It's okay.

01:44.020 --> 01:45.396
But your mom…

01:49.442 --> 01:50.985
GWANG-MU: THE BOYS ARE IN TROUBLE

01:51.069 --> 01:52.112
I COULDN'T PROTECT THEM

02:46.791 --> 02:49.377
BLOODHOUNDS 2

02:54.716 --> 02:55.550
Come in.

02:55.633 --> 02:58.261
DIRECTOR OF INVESTIGATIONS

03:01.264 --> 03:04.642
We should secure and relocate
Yun Tae-geom's family to a safe house.

03:04.726 --> 03:06.186
But we put out an APB.

03:06.853 --> 03:08.938
He doesn't have time for revenge.

03:09.522 --> 03:11.733
Im Baek-jeong never quits.
He'll retaliate.

03:11.816 --> 03:13.401
That's enough. It's excessive.

03:13.484 --> 03:15.195
I don't think it is, sir!

03:15.278 --> 03:19.324
Yun Tae-geom was killed
while helping the police.

03:19.407 --> 03:22.243
I believe it's our duty
to help his family.

03:22.327 --> 03:24.370
Private security can handle it.

03:24.954 --> 03:27.081
Who takes the fall if they fail?

03:27.165 --> 03:28.917
They do.

03:29.584 --> 03:31.252
That's why they do it.

03:32.629 --> 03:35.590
Don't create problems
by protecting a criminal's family.

03:35.673 --> 03:37.342
Focus on catching that bastard.

03:39.093 --> 03:41.804
If you're that worried,
protect them yourself.

03:48.603 --> 03:50.230
You should eat, Woo-jin.

03:57.111 --> 03:58.112
Let's eat.

03:58.196 --> 04:00.365
You need food so you can take your meds.

04:05.286 --> 04:06.329
LEE WOO-JEONG

04:07.497 --> 04:08.331
One second.

04:16.714 --> 04:17.966
Hello, Woo-jeong.

04:18.466 --> 04:20.093
Are you okay, Gun-woo?

04:21.469 --> 04:22.345
I am.

04:22.887 --> 04:26.933
Mr. Min made it through surgery,
and he's been moved to the ICU.

04:27.517 --> 04:31.437
He's stable but not out of the woods yet.

04:32.021 --> 04:33.856
We're tracking your mother's location.

04:33.940 --> 04:36.985
They've entered an area with no CCTV,
so we're having difficulty.

04:37.485 --> 04:39.112
I'll keep you posted.

04:39.696 --> 04:40.989
Thank you so much.

04:42.323 --> 04:43.783
What about Mr. Moon?

04:43.866 --> 04:47.078
I heard he woke up.
I think you can give him a call.

04:48.538 --> 04:49.455
Okay.

04:50.039 --> 04:51.207
Gun-woo.

04:51.916 --> 04:54.544
Where will you stay
after you're discharged?

04:56.421 --> 04:57.964
I'm not sure yet.

04:58.464 --> 05:00.216
If you're going home,

05:00.300 --> 05:03.761
could you take in
Yun Tae-geom's mother and daughter?

05:05.555 --> 05:07.348
We do have a spare room.

05:07.432 --> 05:08.474
Yun Tae-geom was

05:09.475 --> 05:11.894
killed by Im Baek-jeong while helping us.

05:12.478 --> 05:14.731
Im Baek-jeong could go after his family,

05:14.814 --> 05:17.483
so protecting them
is the right thing to do.

05:17.567 --> 05:21.571
But the police are in no position to help,
so I'll protect them myself for now.

05:23.156 --> 05:25.908
Sure. They can stay at our place.

05:29.871 --> 05:34.000
Our personnel conduct
anti-terrorism drills with Special Forces.

05:34.083 --> 05:37.003
I think that's when he first crossed paths
with Yun Tae-geom.

05:37.754 --> 05:39.922
Yun Tae-geom introduced him
to Im Baek-jeong.

05:40.590 --> 05:41.758
Can you find him?

05:41.841 --> 05:43.885
Lee Dong-hyeon was a black ops agent.

05:43.968 --> 05:46.179
No one can find him if he hides.
He's a pro.

05:47.055 --> 05:50.266
Now that he's wanted,
he's likely preparing to flee abroad.

05:50.350 --> 05:51.642
We should stop him.

05:52.310 --> 05:54.687
Stop him at all costs.
You have my full support.

05:59.067 --> 06:03.279
It seems Im Baek-jeong has amassed
quite a bit of money

06:03.363 --> 06:04.614
through illegal boxing.

06:08.493 --> 06:12.538
Together, why don't we do something
for the greater good?

06:14.290 --> 06:17.835
We set up a match
so Im Baek-jeong goes all-in.

06:20.588 --> 06:21.589
How?

06:21.672 --> 06:23.883
We offer him a rematch with Gun-woo.

06:24.759 --> 06:27.595
You put up 100 billion won,
and he puts up 100 billion won.

06:27.678 --> 06:29.597
That brings the prize money
to 200 billion.

06:29.680 --> 06:31.182
The winner takes it all.

06:34.143 --> 06:35.603
Do you think he'll do it?

06:36.854 --> 06:39.232
He will if he thinks he can win.

06:44.612 --> 06:46.989
If he wants something,
he'll show his face.

06:47.073 --> 06:49.200
That won't faze a man like him.

06:50.034 --> 06:53.746
He has a hostage. He thinks
he's got a shield against the cops.

06:59.669 --> 07:01.963
I fractured my collarbone.

07:02.505 --> 07:06.467
The doctor also says
my cheekbone's a bit caved in.

07:07.802 --> 07:09.053
I'm sorry.

07:09.595 --> 07:11.722
I should've been there with you.

07:12.432 --> 07:13.307
Gun-woo.

07:14.684 --> 07:17.520
You're not Superman.

07:18.855 --> 07:21.649
Comfort Woo-jin.

07:28.614 --> 07:30.158
And always remember

07:31.075 --> 07:32.410
what I said.

07:33.744 --> 07:34.579
I will.

07:35.955 --> 07:38.332
Okay. Where will you be going?

07:39.333 --> 07:40.877
I'm going back home tomorrow.

07:41.752 --> 07:43.296
I called someone

07:44.130 --> 07:47.216
who can help you guys in my place.

07:48.092 --> 07:49.010
Who?

07:49.594 --> 07:51.471
You'll know when you see him.

07:53.264 --> 07:54.348
Okay.

08:22.668 --> 08:23.794
Let's go.

08:58.955 --> 09:00.373
-Gun-woo.
-Hello.

09:00.456 --> 09:02.291
-Hello.
-This way, please.

09:02.375 --> 09:03.834
Watch your step.

09:08.297 --> 09:09.340
Hello.

09:10.716 --> 09:11.968
Mister!

09:26.440 --> 09:27.775
Min-a.

09:30.152 --> 09:31.195
Min-a.

09:31.821 --> 09:32.738
How have you been?

09:33.322 --> 09:34.156
Good.

09:34.865 --> 09:36.409
Let's play with stickers.

09:38.119 --> 09:39.036
Sure.

09:39.745 --> 09:40.746
Let's do it.

09:49.338 --> 09:53.092
The hotel blast had already spiked
his intracranial pressure.

09:53.593 --> 09:55.511
He was in no condition to move.

09:56.012 --> 09:59.807
The doctors are waiting for him
to wake up, but it could be a while.

10:03.477 --> 10:06.689
From now on, let's handle this ourselves.

10:09.483 --> 10:11.819
I've been thinking about
how to rescue your mother.

10:15.865 --> 10:18.451
My uncle is the director of the NIS.

10:18.534 --> 10:22.371
So I asked him
to stop Im Baek-jeong from fleeing abroad.

10:24.999 --> 10:27.501
Gun-woo, I know it won't be easy,

10:29.003 --> 10:30.921
but can you fight Im Baek-jeong again?

10:36.636 --> 10:38.054
I promise I'll bring him in.

10:42.433 --> 10:45.519
Will he show with a warrant out for him?

10:45.603 --> 10:47.438
He won't care about that.

10:47.521 --> 10:51.901
And if the police come,
he'll just threaten to hurt Ms. Yoon.

10:53.235 --> 10:55.071
Even if I have to offer 100 billion won…

10:57.073 --> 10:58.866
I'll still drag him out.

11:06.624 --> 11:08.334
I'll do as you say.

11:48.332 --> 11:49.750
Ta-da!

11:50.626 --> 11:52.336
Gun-woo.

11:53.170 --> 11:54.004
Someone's here.

12:27.121 --> 12:28.539
I missed you guys…

12:32.501 --> 12:34.128
but I couldn't find the courage.

12:34.712 --> 12:35.546
Du-yeong.

12:37.548 --> 12:38.549
I'm sorry.

12:40.843 --> 12:42.344
Du-yeong!

12:45.181 --> 12:46.015
Du-yeong!

12:49.685 --> 12:50.644
Du-yeong!

12:54.023 --> 12:56.442
Goddamn it, what happened to your faces?

12:58.194 --> 12:59.570
-Damn it!
-Du-yeong!

13:05.576 --> 13:07.369
A mountain of a man,

13:08.329 --> 13:10.664
a guy with a face full of scars…

13:13.626 --> 13:14.627
and…

13:16.378 --> 13:17.922
Kang In-beom showed up.

13:20.382 --> 13:22.134
Kang In-beom was beating me up

13:23.260 --> 13:25.179
when Mom came out of the room.

13:30.434 --> 13:32.144
She told him…

13:36.190 --> 13:37.358
to stop beating me.

13:39.485 --> 13:41.070
She said she'd go instead.

13:44.990 --> 13:45.866
I should've…

13:48.410 --> 13:51.872
protected her with my life until the end.

13:53.374 --> 13:54.708
I…

13:57.253 --> 14:00.339
I can't even stand myself.

14:16.146 --> 14:17.022
I…

14:18.023 --> 14:19.942
I can't forgive myself.

14:22.611 --> 14:23.988
For the rest of my life,

14:25.823 --> 14:27.199
I won't be able to.

14:29.702 --> 14:30.828
Because of me,

14:31.954 --> 14:32.997
Yang-jung

14:33.789 --> 14:35.916
and Mr. Choi passed away.

14:42.006 --> 14:45.718
But you still have a chance
to save Gun-woo's mother.

14:47.636 --> 14:49.263
So stay strong.

14:50.139 --> 14:51.348
I'll help you.

14:52.266 --> 14:53.684
We can do it, Woo-jin.

14:54.894 --> 14:55.978
Let's save Mom.

15:06.989 --> 15:07.990
Okay.

15:12.995 --> 15:14.288
Take a look at this.

15:14.371 --> 15:16.665
BLOODHOUNDS: SEOUL

15:18.751 --> 15:19.752
What is this?

15:20.961 --> 15:22.546
For the past four years…

15:25.591 --> 15:26.717
I did everything…

15:28.844 --> 15:30.054
for money.

15:35.100 --> 15:36.185
I killed people.

15:38.020 --> 15:42.024
Good people, bad people,
I killed them all.

15:43.943 --> 15:44.777
I…

15:47.696 --> 15:48.530
I'm…

15:52.618 --> 15:53.786
a bloodhound.

16:01.961 --> 16:04.838
That chatroom is a hub
for contract killers.

16:05.589 --> 16:07.591
It's anonymous. Nobody knows anyone else.

16:07.675 --> 16:10.594
There's a host, but I've never met him.

16:12.304 --> 16:13.973
When the host posts a job,

16:14.807 --> 16:18.519
someone takes care of it
and gets paid in Bitcoin.

16:19.019 --> 16:22.356
But the other day,
the host made another move.

16:22.982 --> 16:25.442
He offered a bounty
to whoever can spring his colleague

16:26.276 --> 16:27.403
from police custody.

16:29.113 --> 16:30.489
Must be Im Baek-jeong, right?

16:35.536 --> 16:36.537
Du-yeong.

16:37.955 --> 16:40.958
The officer we're working with
is downstairs right now.

16:41.625 --> 16:42.501
A police officer?

16:43.252 --> 16:45.462
Could we all have a word together?

16:46.964 --> 16:47.840
Du-yeong.

16:49.133 --> 16:50.426
He's on our side.

16:56.223 --> 16:59.685
Do you know when the bloodhound chatroom
started operating?

16:59.768 --> 17:01.353
I don't know exactly.

17:01.854 --> 17:05.065
As for me, I joined four years ago.

17:05.149 --> 17:07.776
The other day,
we arrested a man named Moon Dong-jo.

17:07.860 --> 17:09.445
He's posing as a vet,

17:09.528 --> 17:12.239
but he's been tied
to all kinds of crimes, like cooking.

17:12.823 --> 17:14.116
Have you heard of him?

17:14.783 --> 17:17.745
Yes, I think I've heard of him.

17:18.454 --> 17:20.622
If we ever get hurt on the job,

17:21.248 --> 17:23.500
the host told us to go see that vet.

17:25.377 --> 17:26.503
That vet…

17:27.880 --> 17:29.131
Where is he now?

17:30.841 --> 17:33.594
He was released
after his arrest warrant was denied.

17:34.094 --> 17:35.512
He's probably at home.

17:35.596 --> 17:37.931
If you tell me where he lives,

17:39.558 --> 17:41.727
I'll pay him a quiet visit.

17:45.397 --> 17:46.482
Woo-jeong.

17:48.233 --> 17:49.359
He's on our side.

18:04.833 --> 18:06.251
We'll come with you.

18:06.752 --> 18:08.337
-Gun-woo.
-Yes.

18:08.420 --> 18:12.007
My hands are so stained
that more blood won't even show.

18:12.674 --> 18:13.717
Still--

18:13.801 --> 18:15.010
I came here

18:16.053 --> 18:17.513
for this sort of thing.

18:19.515 --> 18:23.060
But he might not be alone, Du-yeong.

18:39.493 --> 18:40.327
I'll be fine.

19:38.343 --> 19:41.430
I hate it when people open their mouths

19:41.972 --> 19:44.057
and then close them again.

19:45.225 --> 19:48.437
So when you find the resolve
to tell me everything,

19:49.605 --> 19:51.023
nod your head.

19:52.149 --> 19:54.109
If you say you'll talk and then back down…

19:56.111 --> 19:57.863
I'll carve your lips off with a knife.

21:29.705 --> 21:30.747
What is it?

21:32.165 --> 21:34.960
There are NIS agents all over the place.

21:36.628 --> 21:37.879
Fuck.

21:38.922 --> 21:40.132
So what now?

21:41.300 --> 21:43.385
Sir, today might not--

21:45.429 --> 21:47.097
You fucking son of a bitch.

21:47.597 --> 21:49.391
You said you could do it, didn't you?

21:50.100 --> 21:52.394
When are you gonna stop fucking things up?

21:53.854 --> 21:56.857
You need to… get out of here right now.

21:58.400 --> 21:59.526
Listen carefully.

22:00.068 --> 22:01.695
One more mistake,

22:02.446 --> 22:04.448
and I'll butcher your mom and dad.

22:04.948 --> 22:07.284
-Got it?
-Yes.

22:07.784 --> 22:10.871
Your call has been forwarded
to an automated voice messaging system…

22:14.082 --> 22:17.627
Your call has been forwarded
to an automated voice messaging system…

22:20.213 --> 22:22.341
-Are these the right numbers?
-Yes.

22:22.924 --> 22:25.469
These are the five burner phone numbers
Lee Man-bae uses.

22:26.178 --> 22:28.555
Du-yeong got them from Moon Dong-jo.

22:34.227 --> 22:35.854
-Min-beom.
-Yeah?

22:35.937 --> 22:37.481
What if…

22:39.858 --> 22:42.194
I joined Gun-woo in the fight?

22:44.738 --> 22:46.448
If we suggest a two-on-two,

22:47.074 --> 22:49.951
Kang In-beom will step into the ring too.

22:50.994 --> 22:51.828
When he does,

22:53.246 --> 22:56.041
while Gun-woo and I are fighting…

22:58.043 --> 22:59.461
please…

23:04.508 --> 23:07.803
Please promise you'll save Mom.

23:11.056 --> 23:12.015
Yes.

23:13.016 --> 23:13.850
I promise.

23:15.310 --> 23:16.144
Okay.

23:42.003 --> 23:43.088
Lee Man-bae.

23:43.964 --> 23:45.090
Who is this?

23:45.173 --> 23:46.425
It's Hong Min-beom.

23:48.009 --> 23:49.302
Put Im Baek-jeong on.

23:52.389 --> 23:53.473
And if I say no?

23:54.724 --> 23:57.853
Lee Dong-hyeon. Isn't your mother
in a Chuncheon nursing home?

23:59.062 --> 24:00.856
I'm no saint either.

24:16.037 --> 24:17.998
Sir, it's Hong Min-beom.

24:22.294 --> 24:23.253
Did you call him?

24:23.336 --> 24:24.546
No, sir.

24:30.469 --> 24:31.303
Talk.

24:32.304 --> 24:33.972
Let's have a two-on-two fight.

24:35.640 --> 24:39.603
Gun-woo and Woo-jin
against you and Kang In-beom.

24:39.686 --> 24:40.645
Why should I?

24:41.646 --> 24:45.817
We each put up 100 billion won.
Winner takes all.

25:04.085 --> 25:05.045
Let go of me!

25:08.507 --> 25:10.884
-Let go!
-Hand it over!

25:11.384 --> 25:12.344
Let go of me!

25:16.681 --> 25:19.726
Convert 100 billion won into Bitcoin
and send it. Now.

25:19.809 --> 25:22.270
Or I'll cut her face off
and courier it to you.

25:22.354 --> 25:24.856
You fucking trust-fund prick!

25:24.940 --> 25:27.275
How dare you threaten me, huh!

25:27.359 --> 25:30.195
Do you know
why you're still stuck in Korea?

25:30.862 --> 25:34.032
It's because of the NIS agents
at the airport, you son of a bitch.

25:34.533 --> 25:35.659
I bet you didn't know

25:35.742 --> 25:37.619
my uncle is the NIS director.

25:37.702 --> 25:39.287
So fucking what?

25:39.788 --> 25:40.622
Wire the money.

25:42.207 --> 25:44.334
Or I'll fuck up her face.

25:45.794 --> 25:46.795
Kill her!

25:48.338 --> 25:50.840
Give me a reason to kill you.

25:51.341 --> 25:52.384
You'll regret this.

25:52.467 --> 25:54.636
Try me, you fucking bastard.

26:05.146 --> 26:06.314
Hey, lady.

26:06.398 --> 26:08.733
-He thinks I can't kill you.
-Sir.

26:08.817 --> 26:10.068
Let me sort this out.

26:10.151 --> 26:11.528
You fucking bastard.

26:11.611 --> 26:13.321
We're dealing with the NIS.

26:13.405 --> 26:15.365
We could get stuck in Korea.

26:15.448 --> 26:18.743
If we stay here, the cops will catch us.

26:18.827 --> 26:20.620
So what?

26:20.704 --> 26:21.871
I…

26:22.998 --> 26:24.749
I'll sort this out.

26:24.833 --> 26:27.043
I'll also clear a path to Thailand.

26:27.127 --> 26:29.087
Just give me ten days.

26:29.588 --> 26:31.923
I'll make the match happen.

26:32.507 --> 26:34.884
You won't have to put up any money.

26:42.392 --> 26:43.518
Ten days. That's it.

26:44.019 --> 26:45.895
Get it done in ten days.

26:47.063 --> 26:48.690
Or you'll be the first to go.

26:49.816 --> 26:51.651
Understood.

27:05.415 --> 27:06.374
Min-beom.

27:06.458 --> 27:11.087
What if something really happens to Mom?

27:13.006 --> 27:14.382
Let's just wait a bit.

27:36.655 --> 27:38.198
President Hong Min-beom.

27:38.823 --> 27:40.116
Respectfully, sir.

27:40.700 --> 27:42.327
Regardless of your intention,

27:43.453 --> 27:45.705
don't ever provoke Im Baek-jeong again.

27:47.082 --> 27:49.250
He's a loose cannon.

27:51.002 --> 27:53.254
Now let me tell you what I can do.

27:53.338 --> 27:54.881
I hope you'll accept.

27:54.964 --> 27:58.301
We won't put down any buy-in.

27:58.385 --> 28:02.931
Instead, we'll bring Kim Gun-woo's mother
near the venue

28:03.014 --> 28:06.101
and release her if we lose.

28:06.184 --> 28:07.560
If we win,

28:07.644 --> 28:09.437
we take the entire pot.

28:09.938 --> 28:13.024
Then we'll leave the country
on the private jet you provide.

28:13.983 --> 28:17.404
Once we've landed safely,
we'll release her.

28:17.487 --> 28:22.075
I give you my word. On my life.

28:22.158 --> 28:23.326
You can trust me.

28:24.577 --> 28:25.620
If by any chance,

28:26.705 --> 28:28.456
anything goes sideways,

28:28.540 --> 28:31.167
say, if the police get involved…

28:32.252 --> 28:34.003
I've got ears inside the force.

28:35.046 --> 28:38.508
If I hear so much as a whisper,
Kim Gun-woo

28:38.591 --> 28:41.136
will never see his mother again.

28:42.178 --> 28:45.432
I trust that you understood.

28:45.932 --> 28:47.016
What else?

28:47.100 --> 28:49.102
Prepare the buy-in in Bitcoin.

28:49.185 --> 28:53.398
The match is in ten days.
I'll reach out two hours before the fight.

28:53.481 --> 28:56.401
And I'll turn this phone off
so I won't be tracked.

28:56.484 --> 28:57.569
Do you accept?

28:57.652 --> 28:58.486
Yes.

28:59.154 --> 29:00.488
I'll be in touch soon.

29:06.786 --> 29:09.289
Ms. Yoon will be fine until the match.

29:11.541 --> 29:14.127
I'll come up with a plan too.

29:14.961 --> 29:17.088
I'll find people I can trust.

29:19.674 --> 29:23.052
Woo-jin and I will come back stronger.

29:27.223 --> 29:29.851
I secured a private jet to Thailand.

29:33.313 --> 29:37.442
Please fight Kim Gun-woo and Hong Woo-jin
in a two-on-two match.

29:40.195 --> 29:41.988
I wanna fight Kim Gun-woo.

29:46.701 --> 29:48.161
Kim Gun-woo

29:49.204 --> 29:50.288
is mine to kill.

30:01.508 --> 30:03.009
Here it is.

30:03.092 --> 30:05.386
GUNSAN GYM

30:05.470 --> 30:06.387
Jab.

30:07.096 --> 30:09.224
-Jab.
-Coach, you've got a visitor.

30:15.438 --> 30:16.648
-Hello.
-Hello.

30:21.069 --> 30:22.612
-Keep warming up.
-Yes, Coach.

30:33.164 --> 30:35.708
Are you Mr. Hong's son?

30:36.751 --> 30:37.585
Yes, sir.

30:40.839 --> 30:41.881
Good to meet you.

30:44.968 --> 30:46.344
I'm Kim Gun-woo, sir.

30:51.266 --> 30:54.477
You fought Baek-jeong
with your bare hands, right?

30:55.478 --> 30:56.604
Yes, sir.

31:01.192 --> 31:02.360
I'm Heo Cheong-ho.

31:04.070 --> 31:05.405
How can I help you?

31:06.447 --> 31:07.866
We must beat Im Baek-jeong.

31:08.491 --> 31:10.410
Sir, we'd really appreciate it

31:11.077 --> 31:13.580
if you could train us.

31:17.208 --> 31:18.793
Do you want revenge?

31:19.711 --> 31:22.297
Im Baek-jeong kidnapped my mother.

31:30.763 --> 31:32.640
I'm not sure how much help I'll be,

31:34.225 --> 31:35.560
but I'll teach you

31:37.270 --> 31:38.688
everything I know.

31:41.316 --> 31:42.650
-Thank you.
-Thank you.

31:44.110 --> 31:45.653
Baek-jeong has

31:46.321 --> 31:48.573
a fast right and a heavy left.

31:48.656 --> 31:51.910
So watch out for his jab
when he goes southpaw, okay?

31:52.410 --> 31:54.954
You know Thomas Hearns,
the Motor City Cobra?

31:55.955 --> 31:56.873
Do you?

31:57.457 --> 31:58.333
No.

31:59.292 --> 32:00.960
You know, that 1980…

32:02.295 --> 32:03.630
Never mind.

32:10.678 --> 32:12.096
This is a flicker jab.

32:12.180 --> 32:15.642
You can't tell
if it will land on your face or body.

32:15.725 --> 32:18.394
It's incredibly fast and deep.

32:18.895 --> 32:21.272
To do this jab, you need long arms.

32:21.898 --> 32:24.275
The good news is he's not a heavy hitter.

32:24.359 --> 32:27.570
So if you can tank his shots,
just eat them and get inside.

32:28.738 --> 32:33.660
But that's Baek-jeong's trap.

32:34.243 --> 32:36.245
If you get inside through his jabs,

32:36.329 --> 32:38.539
he'll step back and throw a check hook.

32:43.878 --> 32:46.422
The real reason Baek-jeong is so dangerous

32:46.923 --> 32:50.009
is that he's a highly intelligent fighter.

32:50.510 --> 32:53.596
He reads his opponents like an open book.

32:53.680 --> 32:57.225
How can I learn to do that?

32:59.394 --> 33:03.815
Baek-jeong ran away from home
in middle school and lived on the streets.

33:04.899 --> 33:06.901
His father was a violent drunk.

33:06.985 --> 33:08.569
One day, his father got drunk

33:09.654 --> 33:11.990
and beat his mother to death.

33:12.073 --> 33:16.411
I think he developed that instinct
from surviving on the street.

33:19.914 --> 33:21.082
Now, come at me.

33:21.165 --> 33:23.167
-I'll teach you how to block it.
-Okay.

33:23.668 --> 33:24.836
Throw some jabs.

33:29.507 --> 33:31.259
How is it?

33:31.342 --> 33:33.052
-I can't use my lead hand.
-Right.

33:33.136 --> 33:36.556
If you do this, Baek-jeong won't be able
to use his right hand,

33:36.639 --> 33:39.225
so he'll throw a straight left, okay?

33:39.726 --> 33:41.394
Now come at me again.

33:41.477 --> 33:43.187
More.

33:44.897 --> 33:47.900
No. Don't dodge. Try turning it around.

33:47.984 --> 33:49.652
What can you do here?

33:50.361 --> 33:51.320
A counter.

33:51.404 --> 33:52.947
That's right. A counter.

33:53.031 --> 33:55.700
-A counter always turns things around.
-A counter.

33:56.534 --> 33:57.535
Now come at me.

33:58.286 --> 33:59.328
More.

34:07.086 --> 34:08.087
Good.

34:09.505 --> 34:11.257
That's the main weapon

34:12.050 --> 34:14.135
I taught Baek-jeong, the Southpaw.

34:17.138 --> 34:20.516
Baek-jeong's fight record is 17 and 1.

34:20.600 --> 34:23.603
Out of those 17 wins, 15 were KOs.

34:23.686 --> 34:27.648
And 13 of those KOs came
while he was in the orthodox stance.

34:33.237 --> 34:38.451
You should watch out for this move
when Baek-jeong is in orthodox.

34:39.202 --> 34:41.454
If he clips you on the side, it's over.

34:41.537 --> 34:44.082
How should I catch a punch that fast?

34:46.709 --> 34:49.712
You gotta step faster.
Boxing is all about the feet.

34:49.796 --> 34:52.340
Plant your feet firmly on the ground.

34:52.924 --> 34:57.220
Drive all that power upward and boom!

34:57.303 --> 34:58.763
Big guys are slow.

34:59.347 --> 35:01.390
Fight them with your mobility.

35:01.474 --> 35:03.684
If he turns, you turn with him.

35:05.645 --> 35:08.106
Yes, that's it. Then he can't get in.

35:08.815 --> 35:10.024
That's it.

35:11.442 --> 35:13.903
The director doesn't share my opinion.

35:14.487 --> 35:17.240
I'm not sure
who I can trust in the department,

35:17.740 --> 35:20.368
and I don't know
when Gang-yong will wake up.

35:20.451 --> 35:22.411
I can't do this alone, Myeong-hwan.

35:23.746 --> 35:27.458
Don't hesitate, Woo-jeong.
This is why Green Pine Tree Club exists.

35:28.042 --> 35:31.254
I'll gather the available members.

35:31.754 --> 35:33.589
We'll follow your lead.

35:34.590 --> 35:35.800
Yes, Myeong-hwan.

35:43.891 --> 35:44.725
BLOODHOUNDS: SEOUL

35:44.809 --> 35:46.227
GYEONGGI-DO
20 GUARDS IN 2 DAYS

35:46.310 --> 35:47.603
10 MIL UPFRONT, 15 MIL AFTER

35:58.406 --> 35:59.657
I'M IN

35:59.740 --> 36:03.995
This is the property linked
to the address Lee Man-bae gave you.

36:04.078 --> 36:06.789
The 1997 financial crisis halted
the campus construction.

36:07.373 --> 36:10.710
They chose this place for a reason.

36:10.793 --> 36:14.255
There are easily
over a hundred rooms there.

36:14.755 --> 36:16.883
It's perfect for hiding Ms. Yoon.

36:16.966 --> 36:21.095
If they hold the match in one building
and keep Ms. Yoon locked up in another,

36:21.179 --> 36:25.016
our odds of finding her in time
become slim.

36:25.516 --> 36:28.895
And the buildings are on hills.
They've got eyes on everything.

36:28.978 --> 36:31.939
Breaching from the outside
is too risky for the hostage.

36:34.317 --> 36:35.526
I'll be in there.

36:38.571 --> 36:40.448
Once Gun-woo and Woo-jin start fighting,

36:41.157 --> 36:42.617
I'll look for Ms. Yoon.

36:42.700 --> 36:44.952
Going in alone is too dangerous.

36:45.036 --> 36:47.830
But going in solo

36:48.414 --> 36:50.416
is the safest way for Ms. Yoon.

36:50.499 --> 36:53.669
They won't get suspicious of me.

36:53.753 --> 36:54.795
Above all else,

36:56.255 --> 36:57.965
Ms. Yoon's safety comes first.

37:09.977 --> 37:12.146
Sir, do you have the Bitcoin ready?

37:12.730 --> 37:13.648
I do.

37:24.075 --> 37:25.785
Come with me, Tae-yeong.

37:25.868 --> 37:28.454
The Green Pine Tree Club members
will stand by nearby.

37:28.537 --> 37:31.666
Once Ms. Yoon is rescued, they'll go in.

37:31.749 --> 37:32.875
Sure, I'll do that.

37:33.376 --> 37:34.585
I'm coming too.

37:35.503 --> 37:39.757
I have to enter the password
to transfer the Bitcoin.

37:41.217 --> 37:42.051
Everyone.

37:44.470 --> 37:45.304
Brothers.

37:49.225 --> 37:50.309
Are we ready?

37:51.018 --> 37:53.229
One, two, three.

37:53.312 --> 37:54.397
Let's do this!

37:54.480 --> 37:56.023
Find your rhythm. One!

37:56.107 --> 37:57.692
One!

37:57.775 --> 37:59.068
Faster!

38:12.039 --> 38:12.999
More!

38:13.916 --> 38:14.750
More!

38:16.335 --> 38:17.920
More!

38:19.171 --> 38:20.381
More! Get up!

38:24.302 --> 38:25.594
Are you okay?

38:26.262 --> 38:27.179
Yeah.

38:48.326 --> 38:49.660
Sixty-nine!

38:51.370 --> 38:53.164
Seventy. Okay, thirty more to go!

38:54.040 --> 38:54.874
Seventy-one!

38:56.792 --> 38:57.960
Seventy-two!

39:05.760 --> 39:07.261
Twist! Twist your torso!

39:10.097 --> 39:11.390
Twist, Woo-jin!

39:12.850 --> 39:13.851
Twist!

39:17.980 --> 39:19.607
Come on, let's go!

39:20.232 --> 39:21.067
Nice!

39:21.734 --> 39:23.110
Let's go!

39:40.628 --> 39:42.463
-Are you okay?
-Yeah.

39:45.674 --> 39:47.426
I've been thinking all night.

39:47.510 --> 39:49.095
Could Im Baek-jeong

39:49.970 --> 39:53.682
possibly imagine
I'd be the one fighting him?

39:53.766 --> 39:56.102
I know I wouldn't.

39:57.019 --> 39:58.312
-Right?
-Yeah.

39:58.396 --> 40:00.815
He's just gearing up
to shut down your infighting.

40:00.898 --> 40:02.691
When I step in, it'll throw him off.

40:02.775 --> 40:03.818
Yup.

40:04.902 --> 40:07.530
Even if it means
taking 100 punches from that bastard,

40:07.613 --> 40:10.741
I'll make sure to bust one of his eyes.

40:11.409 --> 40:15.204
He'll lose his range,
and that gives you the upper hand.

40:16.455 --> 40:17.748
Are you gonna be okay?

40:22.711 --> 40:24.296
I'll do it, whatever it takes.

40:26.090 --> 40:27.675
What about Kang In-beom?

40:30.719 --> 40:32.096
That's the problem.

40:32.847 --> 40:34.807
You might have to fight them both.

40:39.478 --> 40:40.479
Woo-jin.

40:42.064 --> 40:46.652
In the IKFC, they load their wraps
with metal before the fight.

40:47.236 --> 40:48.237
That's a weapon.

40:50.614 --> 40:52.575
That's why I didn't use it last time.

40:53.951 --> 40:55.453
I thought if I used it,

40:56.620 --> 40:58.789
I wouldn't be a boxer anymore.

40:59.623 --> 41:02.710
But… I'm using it this time.

41:04.670 --> 41:06.380
I was wrong then.

41:08.048 --> 41:10.551
The heart of a boxer alone

41:11.135 --> 41:12.761
can't protect anyone.

41:14.180 --> 41:16.015
Mr. Moon said the other day

41:17.057 --> 41:21.395
that to take down a beast,
I must be more beastly than the beast.

41:22.438 --> 41:24.565
That I must steel my heart.

41:27.067 --> 41:28.861
That once I steel my heart,

41:29.945 --> 41:32.198
my fist will become a blade.

41:34.074 --> 41:36.660
And that's how I protect those I love.

41:40.498 --> 41:42.458
Let's steel our hearts.

41:46.045 --> 41:47.004
Ack.

41:48.464 --> 41:49.298
Ack!

42:06.815 --> 42:08.442
BLOODHOUNDS: IKFC 38

42:10.361 --> 42:11.695
OLD JINAM CAMPUS, 12 P.M.

42:14.114 --> 42:14.949
DU-YEONG

43:39.825 --> 43:40.659
Attention!

43:44.288 --> 43:46.665
Let me have your attention for a moment.

43:46.749 --> 43:49.126
Did everyone get their numbered tags?

43:50.169 --> 43:53.797
Find your spot according to your number.

43:53.881 --> 43:57.843
Anyone who leaves their post
during the fight is a traitor.

43:57.926 --> 44:01.013
Please send me a text or kill them.

44:01.889 --> 44:03.349
There will be a reward.

44:05.142 --> 44:06.477
Fifty million won.

44:07.519 --> 44:10.189
Well, fuck me. I'll take that!

44:11.065 --> 44:13.984
Everyone, let's do this.

44:14.068 --> 44:16.070
Let's do this!

44:16.153 --> 44:17.738
-Okay!
-Let's go!

44:37.341 --> 44:39.134
PRESIDENT HONG MIN-BEOM

44:42.680 --> 44:44.848
OLD JINAM CAMPUS, 15:00

44:48.185 --> 44:49.019
Let's go.

45:01.990 --> 45:04.827
That 50 million won's mine, you fuckers!

45:22.845 --> 45:23.804
Fighters on-site.

45:24.430 --> 45:25.431
Please get ready.

46:06.138 --> 46:07.264
I'm Lee Man-bae.

46:12.519 --> 46:13.854
Show me your wallet.

46:17.316 --> 46:18.901
Fucking hell.

46:45.677 --> 46:46.720
Got it.

46:47.221 --> 46:48.388
I'm going in.

47:40.107 --> 47:41.733
BLOODHOUNDS: IKFC 38

47:43.110 --> 47:46.697
THE FIGHT IS ON

47:53.412 --> 47:54.496
Easy.

47:55.706 --> 47:56.748
Got a cigarette?

48:05.090 --> 48:06.341
And a light?

48:38.248 --> 48:40.334
What the fuck are you doing?

48:40.417 --> 48:41.835
What do you think?

48:42.336 --> 48:44.171
I'm your opponent.

48:44.755 --> 48:47.174
Baek-jeong, you fucking bastard.

48:47.966 --> 48:48.842
You're dead.

48:49.426 --> 48:50.344
"You're dead."

48:52.304 --> 48:53.138
Chicken?

48:54.723 --> 48:55.974
Chicken?

48:56.558 --> 48:57.643
Chicken?

48:58.143 --> 48:59.019
Chicken?

49:11.198 --> 49:12.991
You fucking bastard! How dare you!

49:20.707 --> 49:23.543
Fuck off, you tiny prick.

49:31.760 --> 49:33.011
Chicken?

49:33.095 --> 49:33.971
Chicken!

50:01.957 --> 50:03.041
Huh?

50:09.047 --> 50:10.424
Fuck!

50:10.507 --> 50:11.675
Bring it on, damn it!

50:18.056 --> 50:19.433
What are you looking at?

50:23.520 --> 50:24.563
Fuck!

50:29.818 --> 50:31.737
Fuck, what a pathetic shit show.

50:33.572 --> 50:34.573
Chicken?

50:36.575 --> 50:37.617
Baek-jeong, chicken?

50:49.087 --> 50:50.172
Fuck!

50:54.843 --> 50:56.344
You want the fucker dead?

50:56.428 --> 50:57.596
Get in here!

51:10.442 --> 51:11.276
Chicken?

51:14.654 --> 51:15.989
Chicken!

51:31.296 --> 51:33.173
Damn it. Hey!

51:36.802 --> 51:37.886
Stop the bleeding. Now.

51:42.099 --> 51:44.184
Fucking son of a bitch.

51:46.269 --> 51:48.021
If it doesn't stop, you're dead.

51:48.105 --> 51:49.106
Understood.

51:55.028 --> 51:56.696
I did it.

51:57.697 --> 51:58.573
You did.

51:59.241 --> 52:00.325
You did well.

52:08.166 --> 52:09.459
I'll take it from here.

52:10.877 --> 52:11.878
Okay.

52:15.048 --> 52:15.882
Okay.

52:35.235 --> 52:37.404
Die, you bastard!

53:00.927 --> 53:01.970
Gun-woo.

53:04.472 --> 53:05.640
Watch yourself.

53:11.188 --> 53:12.689
Come out, Im Baek-jeong!

53:25.327 --> 53:26.536
Die.

54:52.455 --> 54:53.707
Kill him!

54:59.170 --> 55:00.338
Yes! Kill him!

56:25.173 --> 56:26.007
Hello?

56:26.091 --> 56:29.260
Ms. Yoon is not in this building.

56:30.011 --> 56:31.638
I think it's the next one.

56:32.806 --> 56:36.851
On the top floor, head to the room
with covered windows. Hurry.

56:36.935 --> 56:38.353
Thank you, sir.

56:38.853 --> 56:40.105
I'll take it from here.

56:40.605 --> 56:41.648
Please

56:42.816 --> 56:44.109
save her.

56:45.276 --> 56:46.152
Please.

56:46.236 --> 56:47.320
I will.

56:50.115 --> 56:52.283
Myeong-hwan, looks like Gun-woo's mother

56:52.367 --> 56:54.452
is in the third round building.

56:55.203 --> 56:56.788
Got it. Be careful.

58:04.397 --> 58:05.356
Move!

58:12.697 --> 58:13.948
Yes!

58:38.181 --> 58:39.432
Get up!

58:40.600 --> 58:42.852
Gun-woo! You gotta get up!

58:43.645 --> 58:44.687
Move, Gun-woo!

58:45.188 --> 58:46.439
Gun-woo!

58:48.274 --> 58:49.526
You son of a bitch!

58:52.820 --> 58:54.239
Go for his leg!

59:11.923 --> 59:13.633
Lee Man-bae! Freeze, damn it!

59:15.051 --> 59:17.136
Drop the gun, you son of a bitch.

59:18.721 --> 59:20.139
Drop the gun, okay?

59:21.057 --> 59:22.267
Drop the gun, damn it!

59:22.350 --> 59:23.601
Drop the knife.

59:23.685 --> 59:26.563
I'll kill her. Drop the gun!

59:27.272 --> 59:28.731
This is your final warning.

59:29.857 --> 59:30.692
Drop the knife.

59:30.775 --> 59:32.527
This is your final warning.

59:34.612 --> 59:36.114
I'll kill her for real.

59:36.614 --> 59:38.283
Drop the gun, okay?

59:39.909 --> 59:41.494
Drop the gun, damn it!

59:41.578 --> 59:43.913
I'll kill her for real. Drop the gun!

59:51.254 --> 59:52.463
Are you okay, ma'am?

01:00:07.395 --> 01:00:08.396
Yes!

01:00:09.897 --> 01:00:10.898
Come at me.

01:00:23.202 --> 01:00:24.787
Kill him, damn it!

01:00:35.298 --> 01:00:37.008
That's it! Yes!

01:00:37.091 --> 01:00:39.052
Yes! That's the stuff!

01:01:26.599 --> 01:01:27.600
You did well.

01:01:28.393 --> 01:01:29.769
Well done, Gun-woo.

01:01:31.354 --> 01:01:32.480
Well done.

01:01:46.577 --> 01:01:47.995
Son of a bitch!

01:01:57.213 --> 01:01:58.506
What, you son of a bitch!

01:02:07.682 --> 01:02:09.142
Everyone, freeze!

01:02:18.151 --> 01:02:19.527
Ms. Yoon is safe.

01:02:20.027 --> 01:02:22.613
It's all thanks to you. You've done well.

01:02:23.656 --> 01:02:24.866
Thank you.

01:02:27.869 --> 01:02:28.953
Thank you.

01:02:39.881 --> 01:02:41.549
-That way.
-Walk straight.

01:02:48.139 --> 01:02:49.056
Mom!

01:02:53.686 --> 01:02:54.687
Mom!

01:02:55.688 --> 01:02:56.647
Mom!

01:02:57.231 --> 01:02:58.316
Mom!

01:03:01.569 --> 01:03:02.737
Mom!

01:03:03.863 --> 01:03:06.949
I'm so sorry.

01:03:09.243 --> 01:03:10.703
I'm sorry I'm late.

01:03:11.454 --> 01:03:13.831
-I'm sorry.
-It's okay. We're all alive.

01:03:14.999 --> 01:03:15.917
It's okay.

01:03:26.594 --> 01:03:27.637
Mom.

01:03:45.530 --> 01:03:47.698
What the hell?

01:04:40.126 --> 01:04:42.003
PRE MI-UM

01:04:45.131 --> 01:04:45.965
KANG TAE-YEONG

01:04:46.048 --> 01:04:48.301
SIR, I ROUTED 860 BITCOIN
TO YOUR WALLET

01:05:05.026 --> 01:05:06.027
Mom.

01:05:07.612 --> 01:05:09.697
Mom. Woo-jin!

01:05:11.032 --> 01:05:11.908
Woo-jin!

01:05:12.533 --> 01:05:13.409
Mom!

01:05:18.623 --> 01:05:19.749
Are you okay?

01:05:26.088 --> 01:05:27.381
Do you want some water?

01:05:31.969 --> 01:05:32.845
Woo-jin.

01:05:34.055 --> 01:05:35.681
That nightmare made me hungry.

01:05:37.516 --> 01:05:40.728
I'll make you some delicious ramyeon.

01:05:42.605 --> 01:05:43.439
Deal.

01:06:20.643 --> 01:06:21.727
-Dig in.
-Okay.

01:06:50.715 --> 01:06:51.882
-Woo-jin.
-Yeah?

01:06:54.051 --> 01:06:55.052
Let's move.

01:06:57.388 --> 01:07:01.350
I'm worried
Im Baek-jeong might show up again.

01:07:05.312 --> 01:07:06.147
Okay.

01:07:07.982 --> 01:07:09.316
And

01:07:10.234 --> 01:07:13.988
while preparing for the next match,
let's train for other stuff too.

01:07:14.864 --> 01:07:15.865
What training?

01:07:16.615 --> 01:07:18.325
Training to crush bloodhounds.

01:07:23.247 --> 01:07:26.459
Next time, I'm not gonna hesitate. Ever.

01:07:27.126 --> 01:07:28.544
I'll get stronger too.

01:07:29.712 --> 01:07:31.213
We don't lose. Not ever.

01:07:36.052 --> 01:07:37.970
-Ack.
-Ack.

01:07:42.099 --> 01:07:43.142
Now we eat.

01:08:18.344 --> 01:08:20.596
We haven't met, so I'll cut to the chase.

01:08:21.555 --> 01:08:25.392
It's about the person
who helped you set up the IKFC in Bangkok.

01:08:25.935 --> 01:08:26.894
What's his name?

01:08:49.208 --> 01:08:50.793
I can kill you, you know.

01:08:52.837 --> 01:08:53.671
Ten.

01:08:54.630 --> 01:08:55.464
Nine.

01:08:56.215 --> 01:08:57.049
Eight.

01:08:57.633 --> 01:08:58.676
Seven.

01:08:58.759 --> 01:08:59.844
Six.

01:08:59.927 --> 01:09:01.220
Five.

01:09:01.303 --> 01:09:02.346
Four.

01:09:02.429 --> 01:09:03.472
Three.

01:09:04.056 --> 01:09:05.015
Fine.

01:09:08.602 --> 01:09:09.436
Name.

01:09:10.479 --> 01:09:11.647
Paichit Chaichana.

01:09:14.358 --> 01:09:18.737
The rumor is that bastard is bringing
a ton of meth into the country this fall.

01:09:19.321 --> 01:09:21.198
One ton is worth 300 billion won.

01:09:22.158 --> 01:09:22.992
And?

01:09:23.576 --> 01:09:26.370
You help me, I help you.

01:09:31.250 --> 01:09:33.961
We're all someone's bloodhounds.

01:09:34.461 --> 01:09:36.255
Don't let it get to you.

01:09:38.465 --> 01:09:39.884
You'll be a bloodhound, yes?

01:09:52.730 --> 01:09:53.564
Ae-seo.

01:10:04.491 --> 01:10:05.743
I'll make it look pretty.

01:13:03.295 --> 01:13:08.300
Subtitle translation by: Jooyea Lee
